  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Behind Feng Jiu Ge he sighs that Senior Liang Liang’s final remaining will has been destroyed after that will dissipates. Seven immortal doors is the move that transports Feng Jiu Ge, Fang Yun Hua, and the rest of the Central Continent Gu Immortals into Northern Plains’ Lang Ya blessed land.",
