    },
    {
      "text": "He wears a white jade crown and has a young appearance.",
      "chapters": [
        1540
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Seeing Feng Jiu Ge in trouble he prepares a killer move to help against the silver giant, then hears a companion warn him to dodge. Heavenly Giant Solor shoots a huge beam at him. His defensive methods last only three breaths against that rank eight battle strength, enough for him to scatter into white cloudy light and reform high in the sky. Blood drips from his mouth; his face is pale with shock.",
